 ><strong>Tune your ride</strong>: paint jobs, seat colours, interiors, and tires; as well as a spoiler and a supercharger (which also tunes your car's engine).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in businesses</strong> that return a steady income to keep the lifestyle going.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/da2eda3c89033ff3cb504aebb303238a.poster.avif?t=1782559019\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/da2eda3c89033ff3cb504aebb303238a.webm?t=1782559019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/da2eda3c89033ff3cb504aebb303238a.mp4?t=1782559019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a large open world where you can also visit restaurants to refuel and pawn shops to sell whatever junk you collect along the way of your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in side activities such as backyard brawls.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Freshly-graduated detective James Arnold is sent on a mission to investigate the death of the mayor of New Eastbrook, a little-known city where corruption is tradition. Investigate crime scenes, interrogate suspects, and fight criminals in a city where every choice pulls you deeper into the shadows.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/f1e87ff093ada173f323c1b10c1d62e69030b34d/header.jpg?t=1782559019", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/6d0bbd56136a15a9ccbeaaffa3d7f25a96f1d9c